{"segment_id": "segment_00000", "start": 0.0, "end": 30.0, "speech": "Hello everyone, welcome to Capsule Academy. This is Leo. Today we're going to learn New Concept English Book One Lesson One Hundred and Sixteen Practices. Hope you gonna enjoy it. 好的，我们先看第一个小的单词啊，跟我一起读一下，叫做 a sleep, a sleep. 注意重音在后面。这个单词很有意思。你看 sleep 这个单词咱学过，是动词，叫睡觉。然后前面", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000000.webp", "time": 0.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["NCE", "BOOKI", "Lesson 116", "Practices"], "scores": [0.99769, 0.99116, 0.97672, 0.99903], "boxes": [[[22.0, 209.0], [253.0, 209.0], [253.0, 308.0], [22.0, 308.0]], [[253.0, 234.0], [488.0, 234.0], [488.0, 303.0], [253.0, 303.0]], [[28.0, 332.0], [297.0, 329.0], [297.0, 386.0], [28.0, 388.0]], [[322.0, 533.0], [684.0, 535.0], [684.0, 621.0], [322.0, 618.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000001.webp", "time": 11.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划bil出"], "scores": [0.80819], "boxes": [[[1488.0, 29.0], [1897.0, 29.0], [1897.0, 108.0], [1488.0, 108.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000002.webp", "time": 14.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["胶囊助学计划"], "scores": [0.99938], "boxes": [[[774.0, 653.0], [1147.0, 653.0], [1147.0, 700.0], [774.0, 700.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000003.webp", "time": 16.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["/a'sli:p/", "asleep adj."], "scores": [0.87781, 0.99482], "boxes": [[[507.0, 73.0], [729.0, 76.0], [729.0, 126.0], [507.0, 124.0]], [[499.0, 125.0], [868.0, 127.0], [868.0, 227.0], [499.0, 224.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
{"segment_id": "segment_00001", "start": 30.0, "end": 60.0, "speech": "加上一个 a 这个字母，它读叫做 asleep，对吧？它变成了形容词的意思，什么意思呢？睡觉是吧？只是表示这时候不是动作了，是它保持睡觉这个状态。造句子呢也很简单，它就是形容词嘛。说 she is beautiful，叫她很漂亮。那她在睡觉，she is asleep，是吧？Very good。那每个人都在睡觉，叫做 everyone is asleep。那你想问大家都在睡觉吗？怎么问？", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000004.webp", "time": 46.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["/a^sli:p/", "asleep adj.", "① She is asleep."], "scores": [0.86024, 0.99499, 0.98725], "boxes": [[[507.0, 73.0], [729.0, 76.0], [729.0, 126.0], [507.0, 124.0]], [[499.0, 125.0], [870.0, 125.0], [870.0, 226.0], [499.0, 226.0]], [[507.0, 269.0], [895.0, 275.0], [894.0, 343.0], [506.0, 336.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
