{"segment_id": "segment_00004", "start": 120.0, "end": 150.0, "speech": "练习啊，还是练习玩一个，各位张开嘴，大声跟我读就行了。来了，Did you see anyone yesterday? No, I saw no one. Next one, Did you hear anything? No, I heard nothing. Next one, Did anyone speak to you? No, no one spoke to me.", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000008.webp", "time": 130.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["see", "① Did you see anyone yesterday?", "② No, I saw no one."], "scores": [0.99923, 0.9888, 0.95562], "boxes": [[[71.0, 522.0], [196.0, 522.0], [196.0, 580.0], [71.0, 580.0]], [[66.0, 647.0], [859.0, 653.0], [859.0, 726.0], [66.0, 719.0]], [[69.0, 709.0], [546.0, 719.0], [545.0, 785.0], [68.0, 775.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000009.webp", "time": 134.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["hear", "① Did you hear anything?"], "scores": [0.99926, 0.99515], "boxes": [[[70.0, 504.0], [236.0, 511.0], [233.0, 586.0], [67.0, 579.0]], [[67.0, 647.0], [678.0, 651.0], [678.0, 724.0], [67.0, 720.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000010.webp", "time": 142.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["speak", "① Did anyone speak to you?"], "scores": [0.99934, 0.99143], "boxes": [[[63.0, 514.0], [277.0, 497.0], [284.0, 585.0], [70.0, 602.0]], [[66.0, 648.0], [742.0, 651.0], [742.0, 723.0], [66.0, 720.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000011.webp", "time": 149.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["go", "专"], "scores": [0.99812, 0.57088], "boxes": [[[69.0, 524.0], [170.0, 519.0], [173.0, 590.0], [72.0, 594.0]], [[1293.0, 640.0], [1355.0, 640.0], [1355.0, 715.0], [1293.0, 715.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
